It is Wednesday morning.
I lie in bed and hear the rain.
April in Berlin is really strange.
Yesterday it was still warm and sunny.
Today the weather is grey and wet again.
I slowly open my eyes.
I notice something immediately.
I do not feel well.
I am cold and I am tired.
I try to swallow.
But my throat hurts.
And my head hurts.
It is heavy like a stone.
I close my eyes for a moment.
Maybe this is just a bad dream.
But no, I am really sick.
I have to stay at home today.
I stand up very slowly.
That is not a good start to the day.
